		"description": "<p>(1/Field Rest) 1 Action. You can make a thrown weapon attack against a target you are aware of in Range 8 regardless of Cover. This attack is made with advantage and if it hits, it deals your normal weapon damage and your maximum possible Sneak Attack damage automatically.</p><hr><p><em>[A] The 1/Field Rest use is a counter on this feature, tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Using this feature makes the attack with your thrown weapon (you pick it when you carry several), with advantage; the use is spent only once that attack is made. On a hit, Nim+ adds your maximum Sneak Attack damage to the same roll, without using your Sneak Attack for the turn.</em></p><p><em>[M] Without Nim+ class automation, add your maximum Sneak Attack damage by hand (a card reminds you). Cover and Range 8 are yours to judge.</em></p>",
